invariants	the invariant suite	2026-10-04T16:29:19.0447455Z     limit      read from committed sources, not from a running cluster: this evidences what the repositories declare they consume, never that a control is in force right now. Whether continuous proof of force is required at all is build ticket 65's question and is still open.
